# Game data files

Apply [agents/guidelines/01-data-registries.md](../../agents/guidelines/01-data-registries.md), [02-factories.md](../../agents/guidelines/02-factories.md), [03-js-types.md](../../agents/guidelines/03-js-types.md).

- Index: `const X = /** @type {const} */ ({ [def.id]: def })`
- Factory: `if (!(id in REGISTRY)) throw ...`
- Types: `keyof typeof import('./index.js').default`

Use skill **game-data-registry** when adding a new entity domain.
